# Data states (3 declared: empty · error · success) — visible regions, never blank
[x] state  - empty   -> EfficiencyState.Empty (Model.cs#148); Project (#294) state ladder maps !HasData →
                       Empty, EmptyMessage = NoStats; view _emptyState TsEmptyState (#45). Asserted by
                       State_empty_when_resolved_with_no_stats_and_no_drives.
[x] state  - error   -> EfficiencyState.Error; ErrorDetail → Error, ErrorText = "{title}: {detail}"; view
                       _errorState TsQueryError + Retry (#44, ActionInvoked → RefreshAsync). Asserted by
                       State_error_when_stats_query_failed. Feed_propagates_stats_failure_as_error verifies the
                       primary read raises ApiException; Feed_degrades_to_empty_drives_when_drives_fail verifies
                       the supplementary read never sinks the page.
[x] state  - success -> EfficiencyState.Success; view _contentHost ← BuildContent (#199) renders all 13 panels +
                       9 charts, each with its own empty fallback. Asserted by State_success_when_stats_present
                       and State_success_when_only_drives_present (stats null + drives present still renders).
                       (loading is also implemented — _loadingSkeleton #43 + State_loading_when_query_in_flight —
                        exceeding the three declared states.)

